# Consuming Aberration: "Whenever you cast a spell, each opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a land
# card, then puts those cards into their graveyard." and "power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your opponents'
# graveyards". Bot2's Bolt is in its graveyard, so the Aberration is 1/1 on entering (casting it does not trigger it). Casting an
# Ornithopter then has Bot2 reveal Lightning Bolt, Ornithopter and an Island (the land last) and put all three into its graveyard:
# four cards, a 4/4, with the rest of Bot2's library untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Consuming Aberration
Ornithopter
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x5
Island
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Island
